#: src/pages/settings/playback.tsx
msgid "{url} is the stream address, {encodedUrl} the same address URL-encoded, {scheme} its scheme, {filename} the file's name, {subtitles} each external subtitle (its parameter repeats per file), {title} the title with the episode, {position} the second to start at ({positionMs} in milliseconds), and {returnUrl} a link back here for a player that reports where it stopped. Values other than {url} are URL-encoded. After intent://, {url} goes without its scheme."
msgstr "{url} ialah alamat penstriman, {encodedUrl} ialah alamat yang sama yang dienkodkan URL, {scheme} skemanya, {filename} nama fail, {subtitles} setiap sarikata luaran (parameternya berulang mengikut fail), {title} tajuk berserta episod, {position} saat untuk bermula ({positionMs} dalam milisaat), dan {returnUrl} pautan kembali ke sini untuk pemain yang melaporkan lokasi berhenti. Nilai selain {url} dienkodkan URL. Selepas intent://, {url} berjalan tanpa skemanya."

